=91ngtr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Dngb=E1=BA=AFtbu=E1=BB=99c">AC 5: Ki=E1=BB=83m tra b=
=E1=BB=8F tr=E1=BB=91ng tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Dng b=E1=BA=AFt bu=E1=BB=99c</h3>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0bf140b5-db74-4c1f-9d7e-f95a6c94254e">
  <p><strong>Given (Bi=E1=BA=BFt r=E1=BA=B1ng):</strong> Nh=C3=A2n vi=C3=AA=
n =C4=91=E1=BB=83 tr=E1=BB=91ng c=C3=A1c tr=C6=B0=E1=BB=9Dng c=C3=B3 d=E1=
=BA=A5u (*).</p></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"4a95d16e-5b2e-4c4d-92e9-428f7f408e06">
